# Deploy allowlist: only the preview landing page and the two candidate
# directions (plus shared data/assets) go to the public Pages repo.
# Everything else in this folder — CLAUDE.md, brand book PDF, research
# notes, archive — stays local.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/index.html
!/assets/
!/directions/
/directions/*
!/directions/house-style/
!/directions/inspiration/
!/directions/shared/
